OL,3,GNEWSAWicker sculpture marks 140 years
OL,4,Asince RNLI disaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wicker sculpture marking 140 years
OL,7,Fsince the worst disaster in the RNLI's
OL,8,Fhistory has been unveiled.
OL,10,FThe artwork in Lytham, Lancashire,
OL,11,Fcommemorates the Southport and St
OL,12,FAnne's lifeboat disaster of 1886, when
OL,13,F27 lifeboat crewmen lost their lives.
OL,15,FThey had embarked on a rescue mission
OL,16,Fto save the crew of the Mexico, a
OL,17,FGerman sailing ship which had run
OL,18,Faground on a sandbank on the Ribble
OL,19,FEstuary.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
