OL,3,GNEWSAWicker sculpture marks 140 years
OL,4,Asince RNLI disaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FLytham-based artist Helena Mellenchip,
OL,7,Fwho created the artwork on behalf of
OL,8,FLytham in Bloom, said she hoped it
OL,9,Fwould "spark people's enthusiasm to
OL,10,Flook into the disaster and just to
OL,11,Fappreciate the lifeboat men and women
OL,12,Fnow".
